      "content": "exactly. it's just hollow. i look at my life and i don't see any reason to keep going through the motions. it's like the warmth just left the world and now it's just cold and empty. sometimes i think maybe it's just better this way, just to not have to deal with the emptiness anymore. i don't even want to fight it. it just feels like a waste of time to keep pretending things get better.",
